Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:31:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/12] ggml: split_rows mode of flash attention

ggml_flash_attn_ext_set_split_rows marks a flash attention op whose q rows
are each computed like a single row: with its own n_kv and the same split of
the cache across threads. A draft verification batch then matches
step-by-step generation bitwise. Implemented in the CPU backend;
test-fa-split-rows compares every row of a batch with the row computed alone.
